#import "../template.typ": somatic_page

// PHASE 7 - PAGE 36: GOLDEN SHADOW - PROMPTS
// Mirroring technique + Mad-lib structured prompts per Shadow Work Philosopher

#somatic_page(
  title: "Unearthing Gold",
  body_text: [
    Place your hand on your heart. Imagine yourself fully expressed—confident, radiant, unapologetic. Notice any resistance that arises: perhaps a shrinking sensation, a voice that says "don't be arrogant." *This contraction is the guardian of your hidden brilliance.*
    
    #v(0.5cm)
    
    #set text(style: "italic", size: 10.5pt)
    
    *1. Something I am secretly really good at—but rarely show others—is* __________.
    
    I hide this gift because __________.
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))

    #v(0.8cm)
    *2. Someone I deeply admire or envy is* __________.
    
    The quality they embody that I wish I had is __________.
    
    *(Remember: positive envy points to your Golden Shadow—what you see in them already lives in you.)*
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))

    #v(0.8cm)
    *3. When I was young, before the world told me to be realistic, I dreamed of* __________.
    
    The person who taught me to shrink this dream was __________.
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
  ],
  image_path: none,
  layout_style: "bottom"
)
